#: ../../source/docs/flaperons-on-plane.rst:5 31749f3c8fe14c228da4c74d1acbc435
msgid "Flaperon Configuration"
msgstr "襟副翼配置"

#: ../../source/docs/flaperons-on-plane.rst:7 362be001cd314b15b6873be8d3a14443
msgid ""
"`Flaperons <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Flaperon>`__ use your 2 ailerons "
"(using one channel each) as both flaps and ailerons. This article shows how "
"to set up Flaperons in Plane."
msgstr ""
"`襟副翼 <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Flaperon>`__ 将您的 2 "
"个副翼（每个使用一个通道）同时用作襟翼和副翼。本文介绍如何在固定翼中设置襟副翼。"

#: ../../source/docs/flaperons-on-plane.rst:14
#: b847ffddb4ea45e8a55c11ef3d030a7e
msgid "Input/Output Channels"
msgstr "输入/输出通道"

#: ../../source/docs/flaperons-on-plane.rst:16
#: 16348dfd309d46aba725c3078e9ef07a
msgid ""
"A brief discussion on input and output channels may help.  The channels from"
" the transmitter in your hand, to the receiver on the vehicle, and then into"
" the autopilot on the vehicle are your INPUT channels.  The channels from "
"the autopilot to your servo's etc are the OUTPUT channels. The input and "
"output channels may not directly map to one another."
msgstr ""
"简要了解输入和输出通道可能有所帮助。从您手中的遥控器到飞行器上的接收机，再到飞行器上的飞控，这些是您的输入通道。从飞控到舵机等设备的通道是输出通道。输入通道和输出通道可能不是直接对应关系。"

#: ../../source/docs/flaperons-on-plane.rst:23
#: 1c3334d7191d4ac7a19c9ef73372a7ed
msgid ""
"Flaperons are the classic example of a setup where input and output channels"
" do not map directly.  The autopilot will use the input from the aileron (rc"
" channel 1, by default) AND the input from the flap channel (set by "
"RCx_OPTION =208 for channel x in firmware versions 4.1 and later, or "
"``FLAP_IN_CH`` in perevious versions) and \"mix\" them to calculate how the "
"flaperons on the plane should move. The result is sent out to each flaperon "
"OUTPUT channel (channels 5 and 6 in the example below)."
msgstr ""
"襟副翼是输入和输出通道不直接对应的典型示例。飞控将使用副翼输入（默认为 RC 通道 1）和襟翼通道输入（在固件 4.1 及更高版本中通过 "
"RCx_OPTION =208 设置通道 x，或在之前版本中使用 "
"``FLAP_IN_CH``）进行「混控」，计算飞机上的襟副翼应如何移动。结果将发送到每个襟副翼输出通道（以下示例中为通道 5 和 6）。"

#: ../../source/docs/flaperons-on-plane.rst:31
#: f6239478eeca4b778ec86b18dabb104c
msgid "Flaperon setup"
msgstr "襟副翼设置"

#: ../../source/docs/flaperons-on-plane.rst:33
#: 7f6844d7bc6848f7ae4bf4c98c97134d
msgid "Do not do any aileron mixing on your transmitter."
msgstr "不要在遥控器上进行任何副翼混控。"

#: ../../source/docs/flaperons-on-plane.rst:34
#: 3e85478dc31045c8bbfeea4bd92e9d89
msgid "INPUTS:"
msgstr "输入："

#: ../../source/docs/flaperons-on-plane.rst:36
#: c1a497a837ea46d0981a7a1be25317f6
msgid "Leave the standard aileron input on channel 1."
msgstr "保留通道 1 上的标准副翼输入。"

#: ../../source/docs/flaperons-on-plane.rst:37
#: cfa0c91611764475b865e50e3819223a
msgid ""
"You need to add an input channel on your transmitter to control the flaps. "
"You can configure any unused input channel for this however we are going to "
"use servo output channel 5.  Configure your transmitter to use Channel 5 for"
" flaps and set ``FLAP_IN_CHANNEL`` to 5 or :ref:`RC5_OPTION<RC5_OPTION>` = "
"208 (firmware 4.1 or later)."
msgstr ""
"您需要在遥控器上添加一个输入通道来控制襟翼。您可以为此配置任何未使用的输入通道，这里我们将使用舵机输出通道 5。配置您的遥控器将通道 5 用于襟翼，并将"
" ``FLAP_IN_CHANNEL`` 设为 5 或 :ref:`RC5_OPTION<RC5_OPTION>` = 208（固件 4.1 "
"或更高版本）。"

#: ../../source/docs/flaperons-on-plane.rst:42
#: 408dbb5dceb248a583682c7339d2c147
msgid ""
"Move your ailerons to 2 spare output channels on the autopilot that you "
"aren't using.  In this example we are using outputs 5 and 6."
msgstr "将副翼移至飞控上两个未使用的空余输出通道。在此示例中，我们使用输出 5 和 6。"

#: ../../source/docs/flaperons-on-plane.rst:46
#: 0bf082998f9a4b2d98658d95827a9ca7
msgid "OUTPUTS:"
msgstr "输出："

#: ../../source/docs/flaperons-on-plane.rst:48
#: 1c126bdb39bf445f8f27319080077fa8
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`SERVO5_FUNCTION <SERVO5_FUNCTION>` and :ref:`SERVO6_FUNCTION "
"<SERVO6_FUNCTION>` to 24 and 25 (Flaperon 1 and flaperon 2 respectively - "
"which channel is which does not matter)."
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`SERVO5_FUNCTION <SERVO5_FUNCTION>` 和 :ref:`SERVO6_FUNCTION "
"<SERVO6_FUNCTION>` 分别设为 24 和 25（分别为襟副翼 1 和襟副翼 2——哪个通道对应哪个无关紧要）。"

#: ../../source/docs/flaperons-on-plane.rst:51
#: 4d602780118e40268633fe04fb722506
msgid ""
"Check that :ref:`SERVO5_MIN <SERVO5_MIN>`, :ref:`SERVO5_MAX <SERVO5_MAX>`, "
":ref:`SERVO5_TRIM <SERVO5_TRIM>` has the correct range set if you haven't "
"used them previously.  If your unsure usually 1000, 2000, 1500 will work "
"fine.  Do the same for the SERVO6 equivalents."
msgstr ""
"检查 :ref:`SERVO5_MIN <SERVO5_MIN>`、:ref:`SERVO5_MAX "
"<SERVO5_MAX>`、:ref:`SERVO5_TRIM <SERVO5_TRIM>` "
"是否设置了正确的范围（如果之前未使用过的话）。如不确定，通常 1000、2000、1500 可以正常使用。对 SERVO6 的对应项做同样设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/flaperons-on-plane.rst:58
#: 16c48db1f0b647659ace661ec8f2c07a
msgid ""
"Switch to FBWA or CRUISE.  Roll your plane back and forth and make sure the "
"ailerons move in the correct direction (aileron goes down on the wing that "
"you roll down). If they don't then use "
":ref:`SERVO5_REVERSED<SERVO5_REVERSED>` and "
":ref:`SERVO6_REVERSED<SERVO6_REVERSED>` to reverse channels as needed."
msgstr ""
"切换到 FBWA 或 Cruise 模式。前后滚转飞机，确认副翼方向正确（向下滚转那侧机翼的副翼应向下偏转）。若方向不正确，请使用 "
":ref:`SERVO5_REVERSED<SERVO5_REVERSED>` 和 "
":ref:`SERVO6_REVERSED<SERVO6_REVERSED>` 根据需要反转通道。"

#: ../../source/docs/flaperons-on-plane.rst:62
#: e9aee8f8ada349bb92c9daaa4566d34a
msgid ""
"Once this works, try your flaps control on your transmitter and make sure "
"flaps go down and not up. If they go the wrong way you will need to swap the"
" two output channels and correct the reversals."
msgstr "一旦确认正常，请在遥控器上测试襟翼控制，确保襟翼向下偏转而非向上。若方向错误，需交换两个输出通道并相应修正反向设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/flaperons-on-plane.rst:65
#: 7d0e8805eead46baa8af2be78e76abd9
msgid ""
"Confirm that when in FBWA and your roll the plane the ailerons move in the "
"correct direction, and that your flaps go down."
msgstr "确认在 FBWA 模式下横滚飞机时，副翼向正确方向运动，且襟翼向下偏转。"

#: ../../source/docs/flaperons-on-plane.rst:67
#: 00382709d5e5473498deffca4919241f
msgid ""
"Now try the ailerons stick on your transmitter. If they go the wrong way, "
"you can use :ref:`RC1_REVERSED<RC1_REVERSED>` to change the direction of the"
" input channel. If you put your stick left, the left aileron should go up."
msgstr ""
"现在在遥控器上测试副翼摇杆。若方向错误，可使用 :ref:`RC1_REVERSED<RC1_REVERSED>` "
"更改输入通道方向。向左推摇杆时，左侧副翼应上翘。"

#: ../../source/docs/flaperons-on-plane.rst:72
#: ddf34df16b4347e59ddabf1a905bbdbb
msgid "Tuning"
msgstr "调参"

#: ../../source/docs/flaperons-on-plane.rst:74
#: 3a026089d90c4da48408ff27f7724d66
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Go to failsafe setup in *APM Planner 2* or *Mission Planner*, and make sure "
"the max/min values match ``SERVO5_MIN``/``SERVO5_MAX`` (or adjust them) so "
"that your flaps move all the way ( :ref:`SERVO1_TRIM <SERVO1_TRIM>` should "
"also be set to 1500). - Setting the :ref:`FLAP_SLEWRATE <FLAP_SLEWRATE>` to "
"100 allows moving flaps from 0 to 100% in one second.  Lower this to make "
"your flaps move more slowly."
msgstr ""
"在 *APM Planner 2* 或 *Mission Planner* 中进入失控保护设置，确保最大/最小值与 "
"``SERVO5_MIN``/``SERVO5_MAX`` 匹配（或进行调整），以使襟翼完全运动（ :ref:`SERVO1_TRIM "
"<SERVO1_TRIM>` 也应设置为 1500）。将 :ref:`FLAP_SLEWRATE <FLAP_SLEWRATE>` 设为 100 "
"可使襟翼在一秒内从 0 运动到 100%，降低该值可使襟翼运动更缓慢。"

#: ../../source/docs/flaperons-on-plane.rst:79
#: e13295d72714498893a2ba01a35ddbb6
msgid ""
"Adjust the :ref:`FLAP_1_PERCNT<FLAP_1_PERCNT>`, "
":ref:`FLAP_2_PERCNT<FLAP_2_PERCNT>`, :ref:`FLAP_1_SPEED<FLAP_1_SPEED>`, "
":ref:`FLAP_2_SPEED<FLAP_2_SPEED>` as desired for auto modes - see "
":ref:`automatic-flaps`. Also, have a look at :ref:`TKOFF_FLAP_PCNT "
"<TKOFF_FLAP_PCNT>` and :ref:`LAND_FLAP_PERCNT <LAND_FLAP_PERCNT>` if they "
"are relevant to you."
msgstr ""
"按需调整 "
":ref:`FLAP_1_PERCNT<FLAP_1_PERCNT>`、:ref:`FLAP_2_PERCNT<FLAP_2_PERCNT>`、:ref:`FLAP_1_SPEED<FLAP_1_SPEED>`、:ref:`FLAP_2_SPEED<FLAP_2_SPEED>`"
" 以用于自动模式，详见 :ref:`automatic-flaps`。如有需要，也可查看 :ref:`TKOFF_FLAP_PCNT "
"<TKOFF_FLAP_PCNT>` 和 :ref:`LAND_FLAP_PERCNT <LAND_FLAP_PERCNT>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/flaperons-on-plane.rst:81
#: d522985b345a46109954f6a06e2b0dea
msgid ""
"When you are flying in manual mode, it can be helpful to setup an elevator "
"down mix on your TX when you set flaps i.e. the more flaps you send, the "
"more elevator down you should send to correct pitch up from flaps. If "
"possible set up the mix value on a rotary switch so that you can control the"
" elevator down correction during a test flight.  If you set too much "
"elevator down as a fixed value in your mix, you'll be stuck not being able "
"to use flaps for landing if you put too much elevator down."
msgstr ""
"在 Manual "
"模式飞行时，建议在遥控器上设置襟翼与升降舵的联动下偏混控，即放下的襟翼越多，应相应下压的升降舵也越多，以修正襟翼引起的抬头力矩。若可能，将混控量设置在旋钮上，以便在试飞时调整升降舵下压量。若在混控中设置了过大的固定升降舵下压量，降落时将无法有效使用襟翼。"

#: ../../source/docs/flaperons-on-plane.rst:92
#: b6d116d3a2a648ba91156bfed00cbc80
msgid ""
"Don't fly until you've rechecked that FBWA/CRUISE moves the ailerons in the "
"right direction and that ailerons also go in the right direction in manual "
"mode."
msgstr "飞行前请再次确认 FBWA/CRUISE 模式下副翼方向正确，且在 Manual 模式下副翼也向正确方向运动。"

#: ../../source/docs/flaperons-on-plane.rst:97
#: 0a5f669c3e9042b6bfe13269785d9f1e
msgid "Crow flaperons"
msgstr "Crow 襟副翼"

#: ../../source/docs/flaperons-on-plane.rst:99
#: 0cf503b283cf473598441fceb42e83f2
msgid ""
"You can also setup crow flaps (where the ailerons go up, not down) by "
"swapping the two output channels and setting the channel reversal as needed."
msgstr "也可设置 Crow 襟翼（副翼向上而非向下偏转），方法是交换两个输出通道并按需设置通道反向。"

#: ../../source/docs/flaperons-on-plane.rst:104
#: 1cb2c048ff5b4630b41a6bbff6f59eeb
msgid "Notes"
msgstr "注意事项"

#: ../../source/docs/flaperons-on-plane.rst:106
#: 2c46be4d8e0544f6a43ada271b63e390
msgid ""
"Manual flaps input is mixed into auto modes. That means if you're landing in"
" manual mode with flaps set to full on your transmitter, and you flip the "
"mode to RTL or some other mode to abort the landing and go back to an auto "
"mode, flaps will stay full. You need to retract them on your transimitter."
msgstr ""
"手动襟翼输入会混入自动模式。这意味着，如果在 Manual 模式下着陆时遥控器上的襟翼已设为全展，然后切换到 RTL "
"或其他模式中止着陆并返回自动模式，襟翼将保持全展状态，需要在遥控器上手动收回。"

#: ../../source/docs/flaperons-on-plane.rst:111
#: c19b6253fcc542f1929a0e617fbdbad7
msgid ""
"``SERVOx_MIN`` and ``SERVOx_MAX`` for Flaperon output channels limit "
"deflection of Flaperons and you can use the TRIM value to move the neutral "
"position in case you want more down travel than up travel."
msgstr ""
"用于副翼襟翼输出通道的 ``SERVOx_MIN`` 和 ``SERVOx_MAX`` 限制了副翼襟翼的偏转量，可使用 TRIM "
"值移动中立位置，以便在需要时使向下行程大于向上行程。"

#: ../../source/docs/flaperons-on-plane.rst:114
#: f90162de38ad4a4ca506cc45f02d5d12
msgid ""
"``SERVO1_TRIM`` acts as normal aileron trim.  ``SERVO1_MIN`` and "
"``SERVO1_MAX`` should match the transmitter setting"
msgstr "``SERVO1_TRIM`` 作为普通副翼配平使用。``SERVO1_MIN`` 和 ``SERVO1_MAX`` 应与遥控器设置匹配。"
